# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Compiled Object files, Static and Dynamic libs (Shared Objects)
*.o
*.a

# OS General
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# project
*.cert
*.key
*.log
# Reviewed, redacted acceptance evidence for this task is part of delivery.
!docs/evidence/gov-acc-v12-01/**/*.log
!docs/evidence/gov-quota-ent-20260924/*.log
!docs/evidence/gov-quota-ent-review-20260924/*.log
bin/
# 隔离实验镜像产物（scripts/lab/build-images.sh 默认输出目录）
build/
# 但 tools/localdeps 下是接管的源码，目录名恰好叫 build 也必须被跟踪：
# 否则干净 checkout 缺少 internal/build，本地 gow 直接编不出来（T13 实测）。
!tools/localdeps/**/build/

# Develop tools
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ZCode CLI - 忽略会话级临时产物（plans/state 等），保留项目级 skills
.zcode/*
!.zcode/skills/

# 浏览器 e2e 测试产物（截图、playwright 缓存）
chk-*.png
.playwright-mcp/

# GUI e2e 扫测截图证据（会话产物不入库）
gui-test-screenshots/

# Backend dependencies and local workspaces
vendor/
go.work
go.work.sum
__pycache__/

# This immutable backup evidence is covered by third_party/tx7do/SHA256SUMS.
!third_party/tx7do/buf/verification.log

# make tools-integration 的用 protoc 现场生成这些上游样例产物，不入库（原件在
# migration/patches/T09/_integration_staging 与锁定归档里，哈希已登记）。
pkg/localdeps/go-wind-toolkit/protoc-gen-go-redact/testdata/integration/*.pb.go
pkg/localdeps/go-wind-toolkit/protoc-gen-go-redact/protoc-gen-redact

# 本地工程技能任务、规格和会话过程材料
.scratch/
